      "name": "Key Case",
      "slug": "key-case",
      "teaser": "A mod that adds a recreation of the Key Case container which is available on the live server, and the barter trade to buy it from Therapist.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2881.png",
      "downloads": 9224,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>A simple mod which recreates the Key Case, which is available on the live servers.</p>\n<p>The case can hold keys, keycards, Gingy keychain, key tools and keycard holders.<br />\nIt can be obtained via the same barter as on live servers from Therapist LL1 and Ref LL2.</p>\n<p>A massive thank you to DrakiaXYZ and Jehree for allowing me to use some code from their Gilded Key Storage Mod to get this working.</p>\n<p>Also, a thank you to Dsnyder, Groovy, and Tron from Discord for helping me maintain my sanity while attempting to make the model work.</p>\n",
